    {
      "text": "seek wisdom, then shall mysteries of God be unfolded, D&C 6:7 (11:7). if thou inquire, thou shalt know mysteries of God, D&C 6:11 (8:11; 42:61). the Lord explains mystery, D&C 10:64 (19:8; 38:13). mystery of godliness, how great it is, D&C 19:10. Joseph Smith given keys of mysteries and sealed revelations, D&C 28:7 (35:18; 64:5). if thou ask, thou shalt receive revelations to know mysteries and peaceable things, D&C 42:61, 65. world not to know mysteries, D&C 42:65. if mysteries are desired, provide support for Joseph Smith, D&C 43:13. he who keeps commandments will be given mysteries of kingdom, D&C 63:23. mysteries to be well of living water to everlasting life, D&C 63:23. expound mysteries out of scriptures, D&C 71:1. the Lord reveals mysteries of kingdom to those who serve him, D&C 76:7. the Lord reveals secrets of his will to those who serve him, D&C 76:10. mysteries of kingdom surpass all understanding, D&C 76:114. book which John saw contains mysteries, D&C 77:6. Melchizedek Priesthood holds keys of mysteries of knowledge of God, D&C 84:19 (107:18–19). Parley P. Pratt is blessed in expounding all scriptures and mysteries to edification of school, D&C 97:5. at his coming the Lord will reveal hidden things which no man knew, D&C 101:33. Melchizedek Priesthood to have privilege of receiving mysteries of kingdom, D&C 107:19.",
